rldly considerations may have no weight when the law of God is to be observed; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Eruvin.63a.13\" data-ref=\"Eruvin 63a:13\">Erub. 63ᵃ</a>; a. e."}], "morphology": "f."}, "plural_form": [], "alt_headwords": [], "quotes": [], "prev_hw": "תְּבוּאָה", "next_hw": "תְּבוּסָה", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Jastrow Dictionary", "language": "heb.talmudic", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Jastrow Dictionary", "attribution": "Rabbi Marcus Jastrow", "index_title": "Jastrow", "version_title": "London, Luzac, 1903", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "תְּבוּנָה", "parent_lexicon": "Klein Dictionary", "content": {"morphology": "f.n.", "senses": [{"definition": "understanding, intelligence.", "number": "1"}, {"definition": "wisdom.", "number": "2"}]}, "rid": "V00086", "refs": ["Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, בִּינָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּכוּנָה ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, כון ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּמוּרָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, מור 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּאָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נוא 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּפָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נוף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּעוּדָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, עוד 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּקוּפָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, קוף 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּמָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רום 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רוע 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, שׁוב ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, בִּינָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּכוּנָה ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, כון ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּמוּרָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, מור 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּאָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נוא 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּפָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נוף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּעוּדָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, עוד 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּקוּפָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, קוף 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּמָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רום 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רוע 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, שׁוב ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1"], "prev_hw": "תִּבּוּל", "next_hw": "תְּבוּנִי", "notes": "[Verbal n. of <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_בין ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1\">הֵבִין</a> (= he understood), form ‘taqtūl’, Hiph. of <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_בין ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, בין ᴵ 1\">בין</a>; however, it could belong also to the Qal, although this latter occurs very rarely (cp. the parallel form <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_בִּינָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, בִּינָה 1\">בִּינָה</a>, which derives from the Qal). Other transitive verbal nouns of the form ‘taqtūl’, related to the Hiph‘īl, are <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּכוּנָה ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּכוּנָה ᴵ 1\">תְּכוּנָה</a> (= arrangement) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_כון ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, כון ᴵ 1\">הֵכִין</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּמוּרָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּמוּרָה 1\">תְּמוּרָה</a> (= substitution, exchange) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_מור.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, מור 1\">הֵמִיר</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּנוּאָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּאָה 1\">תְּנוּאָה</a> (= occasion for hostility) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_נוא.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, נוא 1\">הֵנִיא</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּנוּפָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּנוּפָה 1\">תְּנוּפָה</a> (= movement, motion) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_נוף ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, נוף ᴵ 1\">הֵנִיף</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּעוּדָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּעוּדָה 1\">תְּעוּדָה</a> (= attestation) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_עוד.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, עוד 1\">הֵעִיד</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּקוּפָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּקוּפָה 1\">תְּקוּפָה</a> (= circuit, revolution) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_נקף ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1\">הִקִּיף</a>, Hiph. of <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_נקף ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, נקף ᴵ 1\">נקף</a> = <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_קוף.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, קוף 1\">קוף</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּרוּמָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּמָה 1\">תְּרוּמָה</a> (= contribution, gift) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_רום.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, רום 1\">הֵרִים</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּרוּעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּרוּעָה 1\">תְּרוּעָה</a> (= shout, cry, alarm) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_רוע.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, רוע 1\">הֵרִיעַ</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּשׁוּבָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1\">תְּשׁוּבָה</a> (= answer, reply) from <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_שׁוב ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, שׁוב ᴵ 1\">הֵשִׁיב</a> (however in the sense ‘return’, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תְּשׁוּבָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תְּשׁוּבָה 1\">תְּשׁוּבָה</a> comes from the Qal).]", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Klein Dictionary", "language": "heb.modern", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Klein Dictionary", "attribution": "Ezra Klein", "index_title": "Klein Dictionary", "version_title": "Carta Jerusalem; 1st edition, 1987", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "תְּבוּנָה", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong>n.f. understanding</strong> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.28\">Dt 32:28</a> + 27 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.1\">Pr 5:1</a> + 7 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תובנתו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:12\" href=\"/Job.26.12\">Jb 26:12</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָתוֹ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:2\" href=\"/Hosea.13.2\">Ho 13:2</a> for <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָתָם</span> v. De <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:5\" href=\"/Psalms.27.5\">ψ 27:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:4\" href=\"/Psalms.49.4\">ψ 49:4</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנוֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:11\" href=\"/Job.32.11\">Jb 32:11</a>;—"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<em>the act</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:12\" href=\"/Job.26.12\">Jb 26:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:72\" href=\"/Psalms.78.72\">ψ 78:72</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:5\" href=\"/Psalms.136.5\">136:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.19\">Pr 3:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.30\">21:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.3\">24:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.12\">Je 10:12</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.15\">51:15</a>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.4\">Ez 28:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:2\" href=\"/Hosea.13.2\">Ho 13:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:7\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.7\">Ob 7</a>."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<em>the faculty</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:3\" href=\"/Exo